            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>PS Nest 1.3.0</title></head><body><h1>PS Nest 1.3.0 — Custom materials</h1><ul><li>Choose Custom material at the top of the material list. Enter its name, family, stock size and thickness.</li><li>Use a shop cutter or name a custom cutting process with a router bit, kerf or knife.</li><li>Custom settings are kept with your saved job.</li><li>The offcut switch now fits in a compact row, still on by default.</li></ul><p>Custom machine compatibility needs operator confirmation. Known material-family limits remain in place.</p></body></html>]]></description>
